  "markup": "<nav class=\"plan-local-nav\" aria-label=\"本次旅行目录\"><a href=\"#compare\">绍兴</a><a href=\"#sights\">游玩地点</a><a href=\"#planner\">路线方案</a><a href=\"#map\">行程地图</a><a href=\"#budget\">预算</a><a href=\"#trains\">交通</a><a href=\"#prepare\">准备清单</a></nav><section id=\"compare\" class=\"compare wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"section-head\"><h2>沿着河，慢慢走。</h2></div>\r\n    <a class=\"destination destination-banner shaoxing\" href=\"#planner\" aria-label=\"查看绍兴行程\"><img src=\"/images/trips/autumn-meet-2026/reference/shaoxing.jpg\" alt=\"绍兴安昌古镇河道、乌篷船与临水老屋\" width=\"679\" height=\"453\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"image-shade\"></span><span class=\"photo-bottom\"><strong>安昌古镇</strong><span class=\"round-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></a>\r\n    <div class=\"editor-note\"><span>怎么汇合</span><p>前一晚，北京出发的一方经杭州东换乘，和上海出发的一方搭上同一趟车，一起到绍兴北站。第二天开始游玩。</p></div>\r\n  </section>\r\n  <section id=\"sights\" class=\"sights-section wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">02 / THE PLACES WORTH YOUR TIME</div><h2>每一站，都值得慢一点。</h2></div><p>不只是一张路线表，先看看想一起停留的地方。</p></div><div class=\"sight-toolbar\"><span>建议时长为行程预留量 · 图片非实时秋色</span></div><div class=\"sight-grid\" data-guide=\"shaoxing\" hidden><article class=\"sight-card\"><figure><img src=\"/images/trips/autumn-meet-2026/reference/shaoxing.jpg\" alt=\"绍兴安昌河道上的乌篷船与沿河老屋\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"720\" height=\"480\"><figcaption>河埠 / 乌篷船 / 酱味</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sight-copy\"><div class=\"sight-meta\"><span>建议半天至一天</span><a href=\"https://www.ly.com/travels/1043501.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">图源 ↗</a></div><h3>安昌古镇</h3><p class=\"sight-subtitle\">沿着一条河，走进绍兴的烟火气。</p><p class=\"sight-intro\">临河老街、石桥与沿河长廊，是安昌最有辨识度的风景。边走边看本地酱味铺子，尝年糕与酱鸭，坐不坐船都能把节奏慢下来。</p><div class=\"photo-tip\"><span>值得看 / 拍</span><p>石桥望河、长廊纵深、商铺酱晒风物</p></div><details><summary>怎么安排更舒服 <span>＋</span></summary><p>晒酱和腊味由季节、天气和商户决定；乌篷船先问清整船价格与人数限制。</p><p class=\"sight-placement\">单独集中安排，少与市区折返</p><a href=\"https://www.ly.com/travels/1043501.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">古镇游览参考 ↗</a><small>图片：同程旅行。为历史实景示意，非本次日期实时照片。</small></details></div></article><article class=\"sight-card\"><figure><img src=\"/images/trips/autumn-meet-2026/reference/luxun.jpg\" alt=\"绍兴鲁迅故里百草园的菜畦与庭院实景\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"720\" height=\"480\"><figcaption>文学 / 故居 / 百草园</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sight-copy\"><div class=\"sight-meta\"><span>建议 2–3 小时</span><a href=\"https://gs.ctrip.com/html5/you/sight/shaoxing18/18187.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">图源 ↗</a></div><h3>鲁迅故里</h3><p class=\"sight-subtitle\">把课本里的名字，变成眼前的院落。</p><p class=\"sight-intro\">从百草园到三味书屋，鲁迅笔下的童年场景在老台门与庭院之间串联。比起只在入口拍照，更值得留时间看看故居陈设与生活细节。</p><div class=\"photo-tip\"><span>值得看 / 拍</span><p>百草园菜畦、三味书屋、台门院落</p></div><details><summary>怎么安排更舒服 <span>＋</span></summary><p>免费参观按官方渠道提前预约；景点内拍摄规则、入园时段以现场要求为准。</p><p class=\"sight-placement\">前晚到的首日上午，精神更从容</p><a href=\"https://zjic.zj.gov.cn/zkfw/xcfwybz/202512/t20251219_23865046.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">浙江官方文化介绍 ↗</a><small>图片：携程攻略。为历史实景示意，非本次日期实时照片。</small></details></div></article><article class=\"sight-card\"><figure><img src=\"/images/trips/autumn-meet-2026/reference/shenyuan.jpg\" alt=\"沈园池塘、石径与临水亭榭实景\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"720\" height=\"480\"><figcaption>宋韵 / 园林 / 诗词</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sight-copy\"><div class=\"sight-meta\"><span>白天建议 1–1.5 小时</span><a href=\"https://you.ctrip.com/sight/shaoxing18/2204.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">图源 ↗</a></div><h3>沈园</h3><p class=\"sight-subtitle\">读一阕词，再看一池水。</p><p class=\"sight-intro\">沈园与陆游、唐琬及《钗头凤》的故事相连。园林里的池水、曲径和亭榭，让这段文学记忆变成一场安静的漫步，适合与老城人文景点顺路组合。</p><div class=\"photo-tip\"><span>值得看 / 拍</span><p>池边亭榭、曲径与倒影、题词景观</p></div><details><summary>怎么安排更舒服 <span>＋</span></summary><p>日场与夜场分开确认。若选沈园之夜，先核实当晚开放和演出，不默认每晚都有。</p><p class=\"sight-placement\">首日下午；夜场可替换自由活动</p><a href=\"https://you.ctrip.com/sight/shaoxing18/2204.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">景点介绍与票种复核 ↗</a><small>图片：携程攻略。为历史实景示意，非本次日期实时照片。</small></details></div></article><article class=\"sight-card\"><figure><img src=\"/images/trips/autumn-meet-2026/reference/cangqiao.jpg\" alt=\"雨天仓桥直街的石板路、木制店铺和红灯笼\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"720\" height=\"480\"><figcaption>台门 / 老街 / 晚餐</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sight-copy\"><div class=\"sight-meta\"><span>建议 1.5–2 小时</span><a href=\"https://you.ctrip.com/sight/shaoxing18/97321.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">图源 ↗</a></div><h3>仓桥直街</h3><p class=\"sight-subtitle\">留一顿晚饭的时间，慢慢逛。</p><p class=\"sight-intro\">仓桥直街是街河相依的传统街巷，台门民居、石板路与小店保留着老城的生活尺度。适合住在附近，傍晚沿河散步，再找一家小店吃绍兴菜。</p><div class=\"photo-tip\"><span>值得看 / 拍</span><p>石板街、白墙黛瓦、桥边灯火</p></div><details><summary>怎么安排更舒服 <span>＋</span></summary><p>雨天石板路较滑，穿防滑鞋；不必为了拍照挤进居民院落。</p><p class=\"sight-placement\">住宿周边的晚餐与夜间散步</p><a href=\"https://sxzx.sx.gov.cn/art/2017/3/15/art_1486822_17724918.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">绍兴官方历史街区介绍 ↗</a><small>图片：携程攻略。为历史实景示意，非本次日期实时照片。</small></details></div></article><article class=\"sight-card\"><figure><img src=\"/images/trips/autumn-meet-2026/reference/shusheng.jpg\" alt=\"绍兴书圣故里书法墙、人物雕塑与古桥实景\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"720\" height=\"480\"><figcaption>书法 / 古桥 / 老巷</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sight-copy\"><div class=\"sight-meta\"><span>建议 1.5–2 小时</span><a href=\"https://you.ctrip.com/sight/shaoxing18/97323.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">图源 ↗</a></div><h3>书圣故里</h3><p class=\"sight-subtitle\">沿题扇桥，读一座水墨老城。</p><p class=\"sight-intro\">书圣故里的老巷与古桥，把王羲之相关的书法文化融进日常街景。沿题扇桥、墨池周边慢走，不必每处打卡，也能感到绍兴温柔的生活气息。</p><div class=\"photo-tip\"><span>值得看 / 拍</span><p>题扇桥周边、书法墙、临水巷道</p></div><details><summary>怎么安排更舒服 <span>＋</span></summary><p>这里是越城区老城街区；别与嵊州的书圣故里相关景点混淆。街巷散步与单体场馆开放分别确认。</p><p class=\"sight-placement\">三天版安昌回城后；两天不强塞</p><a href=\"https://you.ctrip.com/sight/shaoxing18/97323.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">景点介绍与位置复核 ↗</a><small>图片：携程攻略。为历史实景示意，非本次日期实时照片。</small></details></div></article></div><p class=\"sight-bottom\">不需要一次走完所有景点。两天优先核心一两站，三天再加小院与老街，把路上的余量留出来。</p></section>\r\n  <section id=\"planner\" class=\"planner-section\"><div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">03 / MAKE IT YOURS</div><h2>把想见面，排进行程。</h2></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"planner-controls\"><div class=\"control\"><span class=\"control-label\">玩几天</span><div class=\"segmented\" aria-label=\"选择行程天数\"><button data-days=\"2\" aria-pressed=\"false\">2 天行程</button><button data-days=\"3\" aria-pressed=\"true\">3 天行程</button></div></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"arrival-rule\">两天和三天方案均计划前一晚抵达。住宿预算包含抵达当晚。</div>\r\n    <div id=\"meeting-summary\" class=\"meeting-summary\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\r\n    <div id=\"plan-context\" class=\"plan-context\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\r\n    <div class=\"plan-grid\"><div id=\"itinerary\" class=\"itinerary\"></div><aside id=\"plan-sidebar\" class=\"plan-sidebar\"></aside></div>\r\n    <div class=\"plan-actions\"><button id=\"copy-plan\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">复制这份旅行计划 <span>↗</span></button><button id=\"download-plan\" class=\"btn btn-line\">下载行程</button><a href=\"#map\" class=\"text-link\">接着看路线与住宿 ↓</a></div>\r\n  </div></section>\r\n\r\n  <section id=\"map\" class=\"wrap map-section\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">04 / EVERY STOP, CONNECTED</div><h2>住哪里，怎么走，一眼看清。</h2></div><a href=\"#planner\" class=\"text-link\">切换行程天数 ↑</a></div>\r\n    <p id=\"map-context\" class=\"map-intro\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\r\n    <div id=\"hotel-options\" class=\"hotel-options\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"选择住宿参考区\"></div>\r\n    <div id=\"route-tabs\" class=\"route-tabs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"筛选每日路线\"></div>\r\n    <div class=\"map-layout\"><div class=\"map-canvas\"><div id=\"trip-map\" aria-label=\"旅行交互地图，可拖动缩放；也可使用下方地点按钮\"></div></div><aside id=\"place-panel\" class=\"map-place\" aria-live=\"polite\"></aside></div>\r\n    <div class=\"map-legend\"><span><i class=\"station-key\"></i>车站</span><span><i class=\"hotel-key\"></i>住宿参考区</span><span><i></i>景点</span><span>虚线 = 游览顺序，非道路轨迹</span></div>\r\n    <p id=\"map-status\" class=\"map-status\" role=\"status\">可拖动、点标记查看；用 + / − 缩放。虚线表示游览顺序。</p>\r\n    <div id=\"map-points\" class=\"map-points\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"选择地图地点\"></div>\r\n    <div id=\"route-legs\" class=\"route-legs\"></div>\r\n    <div class=\"map-fineprint\">道路距离取自2026.11.02保存的 <a href=\"https://routing.openstreetmap.de/about.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OSRM / OpenStreetMap 路由</a>，非直线距离；驾车用时在基础计算上加入候车及路况余量，步行另留少量缓冲，均非实时导航，未含停车、安检与景区排队。地图点位采用区域或入口周边参考，来源见各点详情。虚线只示意先后顺序。<a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">© OpenStreetMap contributors</a></div>\r\n  </section>\r\n  <section id=\"budget\" class=\"wrap budget-section\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">05 / A LITTLE MATH BEFORE WE GO</div><h2>这一趟，带多少预算？</h2></div><span class=\"small-badge\">2位成人 · 房价 / 席别可调整</span></div>\r\n    <p class=\"budget-warning\">车费取近期或历史公开报价，仅用于预留预算，不是实际出发日的实时售价。酒店范围为住宿区预算建议，非指定酒店的房型报价。所有金额可按实际订单修改，价格来源附在下方车次卡中。</p>\r\n    <div class=\"budget-layout\"><fieldset id=\"budget-inputs\" class=\"budget-inputs\"><legend class=\"sr-only\">调整两人行程预算</legend><div id=\"budget-controls\"></div></fieldset><aside id=\"budget-result\" class=\"budget-result\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></aside></div>\r\n  </section>\r\n  <section id=\"trains\" class=\"wrap trains-section\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">06 / TWO CITIES, ONE DESTINATION</div><h2>路上的事，也帮你想好了。</h2></div><a href=\"https://www.12306.cn/index/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-line\">去铁路 12306 复核 ↗</a></div>\r\n    <div class=\"train-disclaimer\"><span class=\"info-icon\">i</span><p><strong>参考车次，不是目标日已开售车票。</strong>资料检索于 2026.11.02，来源为近期公开时刻表；本页不公开具体出发日期；参考车次须按实际出发日重新查询。开行、时刻、车站、票价与余票请在放票后以 12306 为准。</p></div>\r\n    <div class=\"train-toolbar\"><div class=\"under-tabs\" aria-label=\"往返方向\"><button data-direction=\"outbound\" aria-pressed=\"true\">去程候选</button><button data-direction=\"return\" aria-pressed=\"false\">返程候选</button></div><label class=\"city-filter\">旅客 <select id=\"city-filter\"><option value=\"all\">北京 + 上海</option><option value=\"beijing\">北京出发的人</option><option value=\"shanghai\">上海出发的人</option></select></label></div>\r\n    <p id=\"train-date\" class=\"train-date\"></p><div id=\"train-list\" class=\"train-list\"></div><div id=\"train-footnote\" class=\"train-footnote\"></div>\r\n    <div class=\"release-card\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">TICKET NOTES</span><h3>出发日期，自己留一份。</h3><p>具体日期未公开。请根据实际出发日，在铁路 12306 查询预售期、起售时刻及余票。</p></div><a class=\"btn btn-line\" href=\"https://www.12306.cn/index/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看铁路 12306</a></div></section>\r\n  <section id=\"prepare\" class=\"prepare-section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">07 / A LITTLE PREPARATION</div><h2>行李轻一点，准备多一点。</h2></div><p>勾选会保存在当前浏览器，出发前再看一眼。</p></div><div class=\"prepare-grid\"><div><h3>出发前的小清单 <span id=\"check-progress\">0 / 6</span></h3><div id=\"checklist\"></div></div><div class=\"travel-notes\"><details><summary>秋色随天气变化，别把黄金期写死 <span>＋</span></summary><p>绍兴红叶与晒酱风物适合作为赏秋期待，出行时是否正盛取决于当年气温、风雨和商户安排。出发前一周再看实拍；当前不提供目标日天气预报。</p></details><details><summary>车站、预约与住宿怎么选 <span>＋</span></summary><p>绍兴住仓桥直街周边，避免安昌与市区反复折返。鲁迅故里免费参观需按官方渠道预约；沈园夜场与日间游览分开核实。</p></details></div></div></div></section>\r\n  <section id=\"sources\" class=\"wrap sources-section\"><details><summary>资料来源与更新说明 <span>查看 ↗</span></summary><div class=\"source-links\"><a href=\"https://www.12306.cn/index/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">铁路 12306 · 最终购票与时刻复核</a><a href=\"https://www.chifeng.gov.cn/zmhd_01/rdzs/202401/t20240104_2225485.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">中国政府网转载 · 15 天预售期与起售提醒</a><a href=\"https://trains.ctrip.com/TrainBooking/beijingnan-shaoxingbei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">携程 · 北京南—绍兴北</a><a href=\"https://trains.ctrip.com/TrainBooking/shanghaihongqiao-shaoxingbei/gaotie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">携程 · 上海—绍兴北</a><a href=\"https://m.ctrip.com/html5/trains/shaoxingbei-beijing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">携程 · 绍兴北—北京南</a><a href=\"https://m.ctrip.com/html5/trains/shaoxingbei-shanghaihongqiao/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">携程 · 绍兴北—上海</a><a href=\"https://trains.ctrip.com/TrainBooking/beijingnan-hangzhoudong/gaotie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">携程 · 北京南—杭州东 G835</a><a href=\"https://huoche.qunar.com/train/timetable/G7529\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">去哪儿 · G7529 杭州东接入时刻</a><a href=\"https://sx.bendibao.com/tour/20241112/27983.shtm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">绍兴本地宝 · 鲁迅故里预约说明</a></div><p>行程时段是规划建议，接驳时间是预留量。照片为目的地实景，并非 2026 年 11 月的实时秋色。景点卡片附实景照片来源。网站不实时查询余票、不自动订票。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.ly.com/travels/1043501.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">安昌照片来源 ↗</a></p></details></section>\r\n<div id=\"toast\" role=\"status\" class=\"toast\"></div>",
